@baseUrl = https://your-app.test
@token = your-bearer-token

### List Contact Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages?page=1&per_page=15&status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Message Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unread Count (sidebar badge)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contact-messages/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer Message History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/1/contact-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
